      "text": "GATE 2 \u00b7 THE BATTLE\none design pulls ahead\n\u00a0\ninstalled base \u00d7 complements\n\u00d7 switching costs\n\u00a0\nWIN BY:\nadoption \u2014 even at the cost\nof exclusivity. Open it.\nLicence it. Subsidise\ncomplements.\n\u00a0\nmargin can wait;\nthe installed base cannot",
