      "text": "GATE 3 \u00b7 POST-DOMINANCE\nthe design is settled\n\u00a0\nthe product commoditizes;\nthe money moves UP A LAYER\n\u00a0\nWIN BY:\nharvesting the commodity\nefficiently \u2014 and standing\nwhere the money went\n\u00a0\nthen open the next Gate 1",
